   "basis": "read",
   "text": "H2763A (cherem, devote/destroy) is not ordinary destruction but a formal, legally defined institution, the herem or ban: its meaning block separates three legally distinct actions, to prohibit for common use, to consecrate or devote for destruction, and to exterminate. Its verses are covenant-law and conquest-narrative material (Deut 7:2, Deut 20:17, Josh 6, 10 and 11, the Amalek command of 1 Sam 15).",
   "flag": "inferential LLM synthesis; the verses were sampled, H2763A read in full",
