   "kind": "statement",
   "basis": "read",
   "text": "Achan's taking of devoted things (Josh 7:1), already analysed in family J as broken faith (ma'al), is the paradigm violation of the herem institution: taking cherem-devoted property for oneself. Two separately grouped families, J's unfaithfulness and A's destruction, converge on the same narrative event from two lexical angles, the betrayal side and the violated-institution side.",
