   "text": "H8074G (shamem, be desolate) carries an apocalyptic register not found elsewhere in the M10 corpus: Daniel's repeated formula of the abomination that makes desolate (Dan 8:13, 9:27, 11:31, 12:11), tied to the desecration of the sanctuary and to an eschatological timeline (the 1,290 days of Dan 12:11). It is a different genre and referent, end-times sanctuary desecration, from the same root's ordinary prophetic use elsewhere, desolated cities and altars as historical judgment (Ezekiel, Isaiah).",
